        "x1": 0.8611045751633987,
        "y1": 0.5995037878787879
      },
      "text": "Proof. The ﬁrst part of Corollary 7 follows from Lemma 12. For the second part, let mﬁ(G) = K −1. Then, G has neither K-fat K3-minor nor K-fat K1,3-minor. By the ﬁrst part, mci(G) ≤ 4K − 1 = 4(K − 1) + 3 = 4 · mﬁ(G) + 3. ⊔⊓",
